    "Ghoul uses native pending grave-summon offer and exact grave serial with a pre-destruction grave snapshot. Only actual own Dragon destruction other than same name triggers; optional decline/accept, separate copies, later death after decline, wrong type/opponent/bounce/grave lock/stale serial verified. Exact QA34315 simultaneous destruction does not revive; QA41120 real paid/attached Code1059 Aura and QA41067 Viola Seed do revive. NonDragon GR host with actually attached Dragon Aura destruction handled using310.8a/701.6a, preserving prior existing card behavior.",
    "Looks uses native destruction-to-bottom pipeline with a new optional-only source flag; old mandatory Fista replacement unchanged. Only opting into actual bottom movement continues to mandatory grave creature cost<=6 native deployment. Actual DemonHand,6 boundary,7/spell exclusion, no optional skip when eligible, BronzeArm CIP, real6-cost evolution/base, empty/locked grave, decline/bounce/ignored source, actual battle-loss followup and summon-cost destruction cannot replace all verified. Battle continuation waits for its replacement followup.",
    "All55 final focused cases and affected grave-watch/replacement/Aura/BlackHawk/LGate/online-save regressions pass. Initial alias implementation used duplicate catalogue rows, corrected to8 native alias mappings; mandatory-vs-optional Looks flag corrected; fixtures corrected DemonHand physical count, LiquidPeople base ID and actual Aura attachment/GR race. Failed attempt logs retained, all final focused cases pass. npm run check/audit/target/invariants pass; old IDs/definitions/details/images/pins and saved formats preserved.",
